Generates an application, sign-in screens, a runtime plugin crate, a tooling plugin program, or deployment files

Usage: leptoskit generate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  app          Generates an application (also available as `leptoskit new`)
  plugin       Generates an independently publishable runtime plugin with an echo method
  auth         Writes sign-in screens into this app: an email-and-code sign-in screen and a "where you're signed in" screen, on the headless auth client, so they work on the web and in native apps
  tool-plugin  Generates a tooling plugin: a program leptoskit runs once per hook
  deploy       Writes the files that deploy the app's server: a Dockerfile, and the target platform's own file
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
